WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:45.309
SHREW'S NEST


00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:49.198
<i>All children love
bedtime stories.</i>


00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:51.359
<i>I was the exception.</i>


00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.350
<i>The worst part of the day
was when my sister came to my room</i>


00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.599
<i>with her red book of stories,</i>


00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.511
<i>open a page at random
and start reading.</i>


00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:01.351
<i>They were always horror stories,</i>


00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:05.316
<i>scary stories about evil people
who took advantage of others.</i>


00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:09.635
<i>There'd be a huge, powerful ogre
who watched over the humans.</i>


00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:13.239
<i>I'd have to pretend to sleep
so Montse would stop reading.</i>


00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.708
<i>But what scared me most
was that every night,</i>


00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:18.399
<i>she'd leave very sad.</i>


00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:22.192
<i>I thought maybe she'd realized
I was pretending to sleep.</i>


00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:24.391
<i>And I felt very guilty.</i>


00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:27.799
<i>It took me years to find out</i>


00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:30.553
<i>that when she closed the door,
Montse faced her own ogre.</i>


00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:32.798
<i>It also took me years to find out</i>


00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:36.074
<i>what the book was that
filled my nights with nightmares...</i>


00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:37.316
HOLY BIBLE


00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:42.230
<i>My sister's nightmare began
the day Mama died.</i>


00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:44.990
<i>I never found out
exactly why she died.</i>


00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:49.396
<i>Whenever I asked Montse, she'd say
Mama died giving birth to me.</i>


00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:51.593
<i>And that's all.</i>


00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.634
<i>So I grew up thinking
I brought my family's sadness</i>


00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:58.431
<i>when I was born.</i>


00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:08.034
Mama wore this cross
the day we were married.


00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:13.753
It was Grandma's.


00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:16.950
Before that, your great-grandmother's.


00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:20.756
It's handed down to the eldest
daughter on herwedding day.


00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:23.635
God willed that Mama
had no time to give it to you.


00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.036
But it's yours anyway.


00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.355
Tears won't revive her,


00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.077
but the Almighty will.


00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:40.799
Let's pray.


00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:43.072
Let's pray hard for her.


00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:46.154
The second mystery.


00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:48.592
<i>Behold, I am the servant
of the Lord.</i>


00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:50.518
<i>Let it be to me
according to your word.</i>


00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:55.071
<i>Hail Mary, full of grace.
The Lord is with thee.</i>


00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:57.032
<i>Blessed art thou amongst women,</i>


00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.510
<i>and blessed is the fruit
of thy womb, Jesus.</i>


00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.632
<i>Holy Mary, Mother of God,</i>


00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.479
<i>pray for us sinners,</i>


00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:05.791
<i>now and at the hour of our death.
Amen.</i>


00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:07.639
<i>And the Word became flesh...</i>


00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:08.595
<i>and dwelt among us.</i>


00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:10.793
<i>Us...</i>


00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:13.311
Why us? We're women.


00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:22.235
Thanks a lot,
have a nice day.


00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:25.680
What's this?


00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:27.679
One is for Mama.


00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:31.316
The other's foryou.
Happy birthday, honey.


00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:35.032
You've never given me flowers.


00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.914
Today's a speciaI day.
You turn 18.


00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:47.518
It must be hard having my birthday
and Mama's on the same day.


00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:49.632
You feeI guilty
when you're happy


00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.118
and when you're sad.


00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:54.233
But it's God's will.


00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:57.280
I envy you.


00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:00.391
You have photos with her.


00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:09.589
You're going?


00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.393
Yes. I open the store today.


00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:13.109
Then here.


00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:14.510
Take this.


00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:17.235
It's Doña Flora's dress.
Don't let her forget to pay.


00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:22.275
Then you have to take the flowers
to the cemetery.


00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:23.440
After lunch.


00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:24.715
Okay.


00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:30.670
Every day you're more like Mama.


00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.996
She'd be very proud of you.


00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:39.159
- Oh, good!
- Hello.


00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:41.238
I came a little early to see you,


00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:44.512
congratulate you,
and pull your ears.


00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:46.757
Thanks, Doña Puri,
but there's no need.


00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:49.150
Here, to go to the movies
with your friends.


00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:51.238
Doña Puri, it's not necessary!


00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:54.068
It is, because I want to.
End of story.


00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:56.229
Thank you.


00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.358
- I'm off.
- Get a move on.


00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:01.473
I don't want to be responsible
for that witch Flora scolding you.


00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.599
Doesn't it scare you?


00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:08.880
What?


00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:11.231
That she's a woman now.


00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.279
She isn't to me.


00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:18.033
You have a great talent.
You should open your own boutique.


00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:20.197
It's my dream, madam, but...


00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:22.909
I've got no money.
And besides, you know...


00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:24.480
Right.


00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:30.151
The money's not a problem,
I can be your guarantor.


00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:33.114
And you wouldn't
have to leave home.


00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:37.873
This is a large flat.
You could set it up here.


00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:39.389
Yes, but...


00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:42.079
I don't know, I'll think about it.


00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.479
You always say that,


00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:46.075
and I think you've already decided.


00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:48.989
You won't do it
because you're a scaredy-cat.


00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:51.317
- You can take it off now.
- WonderfuI.


00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:54.989
Lovely.


00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:59.394
Do you need me to pay for
the dress now, or an advance?


00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:01.398
Don't worry, we're fine.


00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:03.319
The girI got paid the other day.


00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:05.629
If you need it, ask.
We trust each other.


00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.196
And your attacks?
How are you handling them?


00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.630
Fine. I haven't had one in a while.


00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.479
I suppose this helps.


00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.871
Yes, it helps a lot.


00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:21.992
Since you brought it,
I've been fine.


00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:23.992
Are you following my instructions?


00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:25.120
Yes, madam.


00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:28.035
Two drops in half a glass of water,
never on an empty stomach,


00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:30.630
and always just before bedtime
or a nap.


00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:33.110
That's it, very good.


00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:34.630
Thank you.


00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:37.360
Listen, Montse...


00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:40.712
You know my husband can help you
with more than this.


00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.593
He can treat you.


00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.234
You could try it.


00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:46.835
I don't know.


00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:49.910
You'll rot here, Montse.


00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:52.712
And the girI won't always be here.


00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:55.190
She'll meet a boy,
if she hasn't already.


00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.669
She's far too young.


00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:58.439
It'll happen, Montse.


00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.195
She'll want to marry,
start her own family.


00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.232
Then what'll become of you.


00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:07.715
Alright...


00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.430
Let's not get ahead of ourselves.


00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:16.673
Well, I'm going.
When will you have the dress?


00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:20.078
Come in three days.


00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:21.270
Very well.


00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:26.593
Will you think about the treatment?


00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:36.716
Hello!


00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:40.109
Are you alright?


00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:42.233
I've got a slight headache.


00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.229
How was it with Doña Puri?


00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:45.516
Good.


00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.632
Your lunch is in the kitchen.


00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:59.272
HAPPY BIRTHDAY


00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:09.875
Honey? Is that you?


00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:30.756
I see you didn't go to
the cemetery again this year.


00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:35.356
You make me ashamed of you.


00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:57.674
GirI!


00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:29.236
Hello!


00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:36.428
Montse?


00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:39.110
Where have you been?


00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:50.913
No, don't turn it on!


00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:55.110
Where have you been?


00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:57.118
- The cemetery.
- You're Iying.


00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.434
Come here.


00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:02.240
Come here!


00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:13.275
Who is he?


00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:14.960
Who?


00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:17.079
Don't act dumb.


00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:20.589
He's a friend.


00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:24.154
I didn't raise you
to behave like this.


00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:25.350
Then how?


00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:27.796
He walked me home
so I'd be alright.


00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.149
On your knees.


00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:42.400
Hands.


00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:50.640
Pray.


00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:55.511
<i>Our Father who art in Heaven.</i>


00:10:57.160 --> 00:11:00.869
<i>I confess before Almighty God...</i>


00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:03.117
<i>and before you, my brethren,</i>


00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:05.799
<i>that I have sinned in thought,</i>


00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:06.755
<i>word,</i>


00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:07.920
<i>deed and omission...</i>


00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.280
Go on!


00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.155
<i>through my fault,</i>


00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:17.871
<i>through my fault,
through my most grievous fault.</i>


00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:21.195
I'm doing this for your own good.


00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:24.918
You're completely insane.


00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:29.590
Honey...


00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:32.039
Men are instinctive,


00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:35.432
they only want one thing from us.


00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:38.712
It's in their nature,
they can't help it.


00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:41.470
But they can do a lot of harm.


00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.838
I only want to protect you.


00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:45.553
Sure, by hitting me.


00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.909
I don't know how a man can
harm me more than you.


00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:52.440
You're a spoilt, wretched brat!


00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:41.396
- Carlos, will you listen to me?
- Jaime, leave me alone.


00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:42.909
Carlos! Will you see sense?


00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:44.639
Listen to me.


00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:45.840
You're drunk,


00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:47.514
you can't do this.


00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:49.679
You can't, you don't know
what you're saying.


00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:50.669
I can't?


00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:52.991
You'll see if I can.


00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:55.190
Look!


00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:04.840
You see?


00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:08.151
I want someone like this.


00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:09.919
Is that so much to ask?


00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:11.999
A bit young foryou, isn't she?


00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:14.559
Are you my friend or my mother?


00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:15.360
Look, Jaime...


00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:18.034
- Leave me alone.
- You're going to do something stupid.


00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.038
No, I'm not.


00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:23.710
I'm taking a trip,
disappearing for a while.


00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:25.672
- What's so bad about that?
- Who are you kidding?


00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:28.679
You're running away
because you're a coward.


00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:30.712
You are.
You'll get yourself in trouble.


00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:33.559
You'll ruin your life
and I won't allow it.


00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:34.549
Then stop me!


00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:40.835
Oh, Jaime.


00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:45.195
Come upstairs,


00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:48.433
and when you go,
put a blanket on this beauty.


00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:49.600
Let's go.


00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:55.239
Go on, up you go.


00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:21.119
Did you fix it up properly?


00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:23.152
Want me to look at it?


00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:26.316
No need.


00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.557
Sorry about last night.


00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:34.039
I need you to forgive me.


00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:39.278
Thanks, honey.


00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:51.040
But some things you can't fix
by apologizing.


00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:07.956
I need some money.


00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:09.120
What for?


00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:12.718
To buy some things.


00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:15.470
- I thought I'd go out and...
- You're not going anywhere.


00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:17.438
- But I need...
- You're in mourning.


00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.830
You're a woman
and you have to look after the girI.


00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:23.118
Tell me what we need
and I'll get it.


00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:24.320
More.


00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.673
What are you looking at?


00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.712
Mama!


00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:07.950
Mama!


00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:16.796
<i>Our Father who art in Heaven,</i>


00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:18.718
<i>hallowed be thy name.</i>


00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:21.629
<i>Thy kingdom come,
thy will be done</i>


00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:24.110
<i>on Earth as it is in Heaven.</i>


00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:27.517
<i>Give us this day our daily bread,</i>


00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:29.952
<i>and forgive us our trespasses,</i>


00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:33.795
<i>as we forgive those who
trespass against us.</i>


00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:35.872
<i>Lead us not into temptation,</i>


00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:38.397
<i>but deliver us from evil.</i>


00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:40.835
<i>Amen.</i>


00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:14.359
Don't close it, please.


00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:16.234
Could you help me?


00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:19.754
I just fell down the stairs.
Please.


00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:11.480
Montse!


00:20:11.840 --> 00:20:12.640
Coming.


00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:26.512
Why did you put on the chain?


00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:28.234
Well,...


00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:32.197
Because I took a nap.


00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:34.393
I slept badly last night.


00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:45.040
What's for lunch?


00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:50.316
I don't know.
What do you feeI like?


00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:53.878
You haven't made lunch?


00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:56.197
I told you, I fell asleep.


00:20:57.360 --> 00:21:00.750
- I guess I have time for a bath.
- Yes, good idea.


00:21:15.360 --> 00:21:16.395
Montse!


00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:19.750
What?


00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:20.920
There's no toweI!


00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:22.509
I'll bring you one!


00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:25.310
Sorry.


00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:27.639
I put them in the wash.


00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:28.800
Thanks.


00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:41.274
Montse...


00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:44.834
Can I still wash this?


00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:46.000
Yes.


00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:47.600
What happened?


00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:50.675
I dropped it.


00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:51.800
Good.


00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:53.478
They're terrible to clean.


00:22:10.880 --> 00:22:12.996
- Don't be scared, okay?
- Just open it!


00:22:19.520 --> 00:22:21.829
He'll only stay
untiI he wakes up, then...


00:22:23.720 --> 00:22:24.520
Who is he?


00:22:25.120 --> 00:22:27.475
I'm not sure.
I think he lives upstairs.


00:22:27.840 --> 00:22:29.159
What did you do to him?


00:22:30.120 --> 00:22:30.920
What do you mean?


00:22:31.840 --> 00:22:34.159
He knocked on the door and...


00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:35.513
I only fixed him up.


00:23:01.280 --> 00:23:02.190
Every time you go out,


00:23:02.560 --> 00:23:04.630
I can't stop you
from doing what you want.


00:23:05.520 --> 00:23:08.159
But I can stop you
from coming back in.


00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:11.958
So if you've thought of
telling anyone he's here...


00:23:12.800 --> 00:23:14.870
I'd think again.


00:23:52.840 --> 00:23:53.640
Hello.


00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:55.155
Good morning.


00:23:56.360 --> 00:23:57.160
How are you?


00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:01.111
I fell down the stairs, huh?


00:24:01.680 --> 00:24:03.750
Yes, you hit your head,


00:24:04.480 --> 00:24:06.072
and you have a broken leg.


00:24:07.280 --> 00:24:08.474
How long have I been here?


00:24:08.840 --> 00:24:09.909
One day.


00:24:14.440 --> 00:24:17.238
A doctor came. He said
you shouldn't move from bed.


00:24:23.760 --> 00:24:26.194
I had to make sure
you wouldn't move it.


00:24:27.640 --> 00:24:29.551
He helped me immobilize it.


00:24:30.080 --> 00:24:32.389
And this doctor...


00:24:33.240 --> 00:24:35.151
did he take my name?


00:24:36.120 --> 00:24:36.920
No.


00:24:37.080 --> 00:24:38.718
Sure, you don't know it.


00:24:40.680 --> 00:24:41.749
My name's Carlos.


00:24:44.520 --> 00:24:45.320
And you?


00:24:47.040 --> 00:24:48.268
Montse.


00:24:50.280 --> 00:24:52.191
You've been very nice to me.


00:24:53.360 --> 00:24:54.160
Thanks.


00:24:56.160 --> 00:24:57.115
Your suitcase is here.


00:24:57.600 --> 00:25:01.036
It opened up when you fell,
but I think I got everything.


00:25:01.760 --> 00:25:02.560
Thanks.


00:25:08.240 --> 00:25:09.275
Well...


00:25:10.800 --> 00:25:12.836
We'd better get organized.


00:25:13.200 --> 00:25:15.794
- What?
- You have to help me upstairs.


00:25:17.040 --> 00:25:18.598
But I can't do that.


00:25:19.120 --> 00:25:21.270
It's okay, I'll call a friend.
Do you have a phone?


00:25:21.640 --> 00:25:22.993
No.


00:25:23.360 --> 00:25:24.190
I'm sorry.


00:25:26.920 --> 00:25:29.832
Why don't I get you some lunch
and we'll discuss it later?


00:25:30.800 --> 00:25:32.233
That sounds good.


00:25:37.520 --> 00:25:39.519
Do you have anyone
to look afteryou?


00:25:39.520 --> 00:25:40.320
What?


00:25:40.960 --> 00:25:42.439
Upstairs, in your place.


00:25:42.840 --> 00:25:45.752
A mother, a wife.


00:25:46.520 --> 00:25:49.557
I live by myself,
if that's what you mean.


00:25:51.280 --> 00:25:53.077
I mean...


00:25:53.440 --> 00:25:55.829
you can stay here
as long as you like.


00:25:57.400 --> 00:25:59.470
I'm always at home, so...


00:26:02.600 --> 00:26:03.794
I can look afteryou.


00:26:04.720 --> 00:26:06.472
You're very kind, Montse.


00:26:31.360 --> 00:26:32.959
<i>You can learn a lot about people</i>


00:26:32.960 --> 00:26:34.871
<i>from watching the behavior
of certain animals.</i>


00:26:35.280 --> 00:26:38.989
<i>Thatwas the night I first heard
of the Shrews.</i>


00:26:39.960 --> 00:26:43.236
<i>And I recall the strange sensation
they were familiar and recognizable,</i>


00:26:43.600 --> 00:26:44.874
Open up, please.


00:26:45.240 --> 00:26:47.117
<i>even though I'd never
heard tell of them.</i>


00:26:49.120 --> 00:26:51.076
This padlock makes me angry.


00:26:51.480 --> 00:26:53.359
And even more
that you hide Our Lord.


00:26:53.360 --> 00:26:55.157
- I don't like it.
- Don't say that.


00:26:55.520 --> 00:26:57.319
Wherever you go,
his eyes follow you.


00:26:57.320 --> 00:26:58.514
Because that's how it is.


00:27:08.720 --> 00:27:10.312
I came to tell you...


00:27:10.720 --> 00:27:11.914
Carlos woke up today.


00:27:12.800 --> 00:27:14.995
He's alright, except for his leg.


00:27:15.880 --> 00:27:17.074
He can't leave yet.


00:27:17.480 --> 00:27:19.198
He lives alone,
and has no one to look after him.


00:27:19.960 --> 00:27:21.837
I've convinced him to stay.


00:27:24.320 --> 00:27:26.038
I didn't do it to him, honestly.


00:27:40.600 --> 00:27:41.715
See you tomorrow.


00:27:42.760 --> 00:27:43.795
See you tomorrow.


00:27:46.680 --> 00:27:47.480
<i>I suppose I thought</i>


00:27:47.800 --> 00:27:49.631
<i>that since we had a new tenant</i>


00:27:50.280 --> 00:27:52.316
<i>the time had come to meet him.</i>


00:27:53.160 --> 00:27:55.958
<i>In that place, which Montse
hadn't left for years,</i>


00:27:56.320 --> 00:27:58.834
<i>itwas impossible to do anything
without her knowing.</i>


00:28:00.440 --> 00:28:04.228
<i>Living here forced you do
your things when she was distracted,</i>


00:28:04.840 --> 00:28:06.751
<i>to get your space,</i>


00:28:08.200 --> 00:28:11.078
<i>to keep your secrets
out of her reach...</i>


00:28:16.400 --> 00:28:17.200
Who's there?


00:28:18.880 --> 00:28:20.074
I shouldn't be here.


00:28:22.720 --> 00:28:23.630
I know you.


00:28:25.080 --> 00:28:26.991
I saw you the other night,
on the stairs.


00:28:27.400 --> 00:28:28.594
I put a blanket on you.


00:28:28.920 --> 00:28:30.148
- It was you?
- Yes.


00:28:30.720 --> 00:28:32.676
I wonderwhat you thought,
seeing me there.


00:28:33.040 --> 00:28:36.430
That you were the prettiest thing
I'd seen in a long time.


00:28:46.000 --> 00:28:47.433
So you live here.


00:28:48.800 --> 00:28:50.074
- My name's...
- Carlos.


00:28:50.560 --> 00:28:51.754
My sistertold me.


00:28:52.120 --> 00:28:52.920
Your sister, eh?


00:28:53.480 --> 00:28:56.039
She didn't tell me you existed.


00:28:56.040 --> 00:28:57.155
Really?


00:28:59.120 --> 00:29:00.030
Did she hurt you?


00:29:00.400 --> 00:29:01.200
Why do you say that?


00:29:01.920 --> 00:29:02.830
On the contrary.


00:29:09.400 --> 00:29:10.389
Are you okay?


00:29:11.080 --> 00:29:11.880
Yes.


00:29:12.480 --> 00:29:14.436
I saw the light
and heard you talking.


00:29:14.800 --> 00:29:16.438
I thought your leg
might be hurting.


00:29:16.760 --> 00:29:19.069
It hurts.
I must've been talking in my sleep.


00:29:19.680 --> 00:29:22.114
I'm sorry I woke you.


00:29:22.440 --> 00:29:24.351
Don't worry,
I go back to sleep easily.


00:29:25.280 --> 00:29:26.235
See you tomorrow.


00:29:26.600 --> 00:29:27.510
See you tomorrow.


00:29:31.480 --> 00:29:32.469
I must go.


00:29:33.280 --> 00:29:35.510
I thought she was asleep.
If she finds me here, she'll kill me.


00:29:35.960 --> 00:29:36.870
You're like a shrew.


00:29:37.760 --> 00:29:38.560
What's that?


00:29:39.280 --> 00:29:40.080
Like a rat.


00:29:40.960 --> 00:29:42.678
Oh, thanks very much!


00:29:43.000 --> 00:29:45.514
Well, more like moles.


00:29:45.840 --> 00:29:47.796
They like to hide away,


00:29:48.160 --> 00:29:49.752
in wait. Like you.


00:29:50.240 --> 00:29:51.639
That's not me.


00:29:52.320 --> 00:29:54.072
- That's Montse.
- And you.


00:29:54.680 --> 00:29:55.715
You don't know me. Or her.


00:29:56.240 --> 00:29:58.595
I'm sure she looks normaI to you,
but she isn't.


00:29:59.160 --> 00:30:00.513
Be very carefuI.


00:30:01.680 --> 00:30:03.432
Will you come tomorrow?


00:30:04.080 --> 00:30:05.308
Are you thinking of staying?


00:30:05.640 --> 00:30:06.629
If you come, yes.


00:30:07.680 --> 00:30:09.919
If I were you, I'd get out fast.


00:30:09.920 --> 00:30:11.831
But if you're unfortunate enough
to still be here,


00:30:13.480 --> 00:30:14.435
I'll come.


00:30:21.360 --> 00:30:23.078
Sorry to bother you again.


00:30:23.480 --> 00:30:24.280
I brought you this.


00:30:24.640 --> 00:30:26.312
It'll help with the pain.


00:30:29.360 --> 00:30:30.236
What is it?


00:30:31.880 --> 00:30:33.472
Let's just say...


00:30:34.120 --> 00:30:35.439
it's waterwith a prayer.


00:30:35.800 --> 00:30:38.314
Then we're talking about
holy water.


00:30:38.760 --> 00:30:40.318
Yes, something like that.


00:30:45.520 --> 00:30:46.430
Thanks.


00:30:51.160 --> 00:30:53.037
- Good night.
- Good night.


00:31:17.240 --> 00:31:18.434
Good morning.


00:31:18.760 --> 00:31:20.159
How did you sleep?


00:31:20.600 --> 00:31:21.555
Very well.


00:31:21.960 --> 00:31:23.632
That waterwas a reaI miracle.


00:31:25.080 --> 00:31:26.672
I knew it'd work.


00:31:28.960 --> 00:31:29.760
That's nice.


00:31:30.360 --> 00:31:32.635
You didn't tell me
you lived with someone.


00:31:33.440 --> 00:31:34.240
What?


00:31:34.400 --> 00:31:37.676
- I heard you talking this morning.
- She's my little sister.


00:31:38.400 --> 00:31:39.799
I know her.


00:31:40.480 --> 00:31:41.390
I think.


00:31:41.760 --> 00:31:43.830
Dark hair,


00:31:44.160 --> 00:31:46.958
big bright eyes?


00:31:47.920 --> 00:31:49.592
Around 20...?


00:31:49.960 --> 00:31:51.996
-18.
- That's her, isn't it?


00:31:53.320 --> 00:31:54.548
She's very pretty.


00:31:55.240 --> 00:31:56.798
And she looks like a good person.


00:31:57.160 --> 00:31:58.195
She is.


00:31:59.880 --> 00:32:00.949
Why didn't you tell me?


00:32:02.920 --> 00:32:04.512
I don't know, really.


00:32:05.680 --> 00:32:09.389
Sometimes I do things
that are a little inexplicable.


00:32:10.320 --> 00:32:12.151
I suppose to protect her.


00:32:12.920 --> 00:32:14.799
- From whom? From me?
- Yes.


00:32:14.800 --> 00:32:17.075
Well, more or less.


00:32:18.600 --> 00:32:21.068
You saw right through me.
You've got a good eye.


00:32:23.920 --> 00:32:25.990
She's a very impressionable girI.


00:32:27.640 --> 00:32:29.392
We've had some tough times.


00:32:29.880 --> 00:32:33.316
Our mother died giving birth to her
and she feels so guilty.


00:32:33.840 --> 00:32:35.478
I don't know how to
get it out of her head.


00:32:35.880 --> 00:32:38.075
Gee, sorry to hear that.


00:32:38.520 --> 00:32:39.475
And your father?


00:32:40.400 --> 00:32:41.992
I suppose he's dead too.


00:32:42.800 --> 00:32:44.472
We haven't seen him for 14 years.


00:32:45.760 --> 00:32:46.590
- The War?
- Yes.


00:32:47.040 --> 00:32:48.359
He left and never came back.


00:32:49.280 --> 00:32:51.316
I'm sorry. I really am.


00:32:55.240 --> 00:32:56.229
And you?


00:32:56.720 --> 00:32:58.711
- What's your story?
- My story?


00:33:00.400 --> 00:33:03.472
My story is... there is no story.


00:33:04.040 --> 00:33:05.553
My parents died when I was a boy


00:33:05.920 --> 00:33:07.717
and when I came of age


00:33:08.280 --> 00:33:11.556
I inherited capitaI and property.


00:33:12.040 --> 00:33:14.031
Since then I've lived.


00:33:14.560 --> 00:33:15.549
I've lived well.


00:33:17.000 --> 00:33:18.274
- That's lucky.
- Yes.


00:33:18.640 --> 00:33:20.119
I guess, although,


00:33:20.720 --> 00:33:22.278
I don't know, sometimes...


00:33:23.320 --> 00:33:25.595
I do inexplicable things too sometimes.


00:33:29.480 --> 00:33:31.072
Well, that's it.


00:33:33.080 --> 00:33:33.880
Do you feeI better?


00:33:34.360 --> 00:33:35.270
Yes, much better.


00:33:35.640 --> 00:33:37.312
Thanks a lot, Montse.


00:33:37.640 --> 00:33:39.756
You're an incredible woman.


00:33:40.320 --> 00:33:42.515
Pass me my pants, please.


00:33:46.400 --> 00:33:47.549
Look.


00:33:48.840 --> 00:33:49.875
I need you...


00:33:50.480 --> 00:33:51.879
to go up to my flat.


00:33:52.240 --> 00:33:53.832
Go get any of my books,


00:33:54.200 --> 00:33:55.758
and we'll read together.


00:33:56.120 --> 00:33:57.997
And if you like it, keep it.


00:34:01.080 --> 00:34:02.195
<i>Lovely.</i>


00:34:02.680 --> 00:34:03.874
Really lovely.


00:34:04.240 --> 00:34:05.514
You look very nice.


00:34:05.840 --> 00:34:07.478
Of course.


00:34:07.840 --> 00:34:11.310
But the credit goes to you
and your gifted hands.


00:34:11.720 --> 00:34:12.789
You know what?


00:34:13.160 --> 00:34:16.516
My niece is marrying in spring.
This dress would be a fine gift.


00:34:17.480 --> 00:34:20.313
So? Have you ever made
a wedding dress?


00:34:21.880 --> 00:34:22.680
Montse.


00:34:23.480 --> 00:34:24.280
Montse!


00:34:25.360 --> 00:34:27.191
Sorry. Did you say a wedding dress?


00:34:27.600 --> 00:34:28.828
Yes.


00:34:29.200 --> 00:34:31.270
What's wrong? You're miles away.


00:34:32.520 --> 00:34:35.876
The other day you said
your husband could help me.


00:34:36.760 --> 00:34:38.716
Of course. Of course.


00:34:39.080 --> 00:34:41.799
I want to try it, Doña Puri.


00:34:41.800 --> 00:34:42.869
I want to go outside.


00:34:44.440 --> 00:34:46.396
When my husband gets home
from the surgery


00:34:47.320 --> 00:34:49.356
I'll tell him you'll call.


00:34:51.400 --> 00:34:53.391
- I'm very proud of you.
- Thank you.


00:35:00.040 --> 00:35:01.234
Hello, doctor. I'm Montse.


00:35:01.680 --> 00:35:03.398
<i>Hello. I was expecting your call.</i>


00:35:03.760 --> 00:35:04.954
Doña Puri told you?


00:35:05.320 --> 00:35:06.912
<i>Yes, but I want to hear it from you.</i>


00:35:08.720 --> 00:35:11.792
I want to do it, doctor.
I need to try it.


00:35:12.200 --> 00:35:14.873
<i>Good, Montse.
I'm glad.</i>


00:35:15.240 --> 00:35:16.275
Thank you.


00:35:16.640 --> 00:35:17.516
What do I have to do?


00:35:17.920 --> 00:35:21.114
<i>For now, we'll try an exercise.</i>


00:35:21.400 --> 00:35:25.359
<i>Open your front door and try
to touch the wall in front.</i>


00:35:26.240 --> 00:35:27.992
<i>It's a hard exercise for you,</i>


00:35:28.880 --> 00:35:30.552
<i>so it's important to stay calm.</i>


00:35:40.800 --> 00:35:42.119
<i>Don't do it all at once.</i>


00:35:42.480 --> 00:35:46.075
<i>Today just take one step
and stay outside as long as you can.</i>


00:36:29.320 --> 00:36:31.880
<i>- Will you call me to say how itwent?
- Of course.</i>


00:36:32.360 --> 00:36:34.794
<i>- I hope you make it.
- I wish.</i>


00:36:42.760 --> 00:36:45.433
I spoke to Doña Puri's husband today.


00:36:46.320 --> 00:36:48.072
The doctor? About Carlos?


00:36:48.440 --> 00:36:50.158
No, about me.


00:36:51.000 --> 00:36:52.399
What's wrong?


00:36:53.720 --> 00:36:57.110
I've decided
to try to leave the house.


00:36:57.800 --> 00:37:00.872
But really try.
I'm doing exercises.


00:37:02.800 --> 00:37:03.600
What exercises?


00:37:03.920 --> 00:37:05.353
- Going out.
- Come on!


00:37:05.720 --> 00:37:08.598
Just one step.
I got all the way outside.


00:37:09.120 --> 00:37:10.269
Really?


00:37:10.960 --> 00:37:11.995
How did it feeI?


00:37:12.840 --> 00:37:14.114
I wanted to die.


00:37:15.120 --> 00:37:16.155
But...


00:37:17.000 --> 00:37:18.991
I'll keep trying, really.


00:37:19.440 --> 00:37:21.032
I'm fine.


00:37:21.760 --> 00:37:24.149
I can't remember the last time
I felt this good.


00:37:25.920 --> 00:37:27.717
I'm so happy, Montse.


00:37:28.320 --> 00:37:31.232
So what got into you?
Why now?


00:37:36.960 --> 00:37:37.760
Carlos.


00:37:42.400 --> 00:37:44.072
He asked me to get some books.


00:37:45.040 --> 00:37:46.632
Are those his house keys?


00:37:47.920 --> 00:37:49.069
Easy, isn't it?


00:37:50.520 --> 00:37:53.398
Just climb the stairs, go in,


00:37:53.760 --> 00:37:55.478
a few yards, right above.


00:37:57.480 --> 00:37:59.869
But for me
it's like touching the sky.


00:38:01.080 --> 00:38:03.355
An impossible distance to traveI.


00:38:05.160 --> 00:38:07.993
I'm that far away from
the world and reaI life.


00:38:08.720 --> 00:38:10.312
That's how bad I am.


00:38:12.440 --> 00:38:14.749
I've turned this house
into a giant coffin


00:38:15.120 --> 00:38:16.633
from which I can't escape.


00:38:17.040 --> 00:38:19.952
And with Carlos, it's like...


00:38:20.280 --> 00:38:23.556
a tiny bit of reaI life
has come inside and...


00:38:25.000 --> 00:38:28.151
I feeI I have to
make the most of it.


00:38:28.960 --> 00:38:30.109
That's why.


00:38:31.320 --> 00:38:32.196
You like Carlos.


00:38:35.760 --> 00:38:38.149
With Carlos I feeI like
a normaI woman.


00:38:42.000 --> 00:38:45.276
God gave me
a very difficult life, but...


00:38:45.640 --> 00:38:47.915
He brought you into this world


00:38:48.280 --> 00:38:49.315
to give me strength,


00:38:49.680 --> 00:38:52.399
and now He's sent Carlos
to finish what you started.


00:38:57.600 --> 00:38:58.999
Will you help me?


00:39:05.560 --> 00:39:06.390
Thank you.


00:39:20.480 --> 00:39:21.754
You look like a clown.


00:39:22.880 --> 00:39:24.359
You're doing this for him?


00:39:25.560 --> 00:39:27.278
What do you want to do, scare him?


00:39:40.080 --> 00:39:41.877
I like you without makeup.


00:39:44.720 --> 00:39:46.119
Like Mama.


00:39:47.840 --> 00:39:50.912
She never put on makeup
because she didn't need to.


00:40:42.320 --> 00:40:43.150
You're still here.


00:40:44.080 --> 00:40:45.308
You look lovely.


00:40:46.200 --> 00:40:47.997
Did you put on that dress for me?


00:40:50.640 --> 00:40:52.756
Come here. Come sit with me.


00:40:54.760 --> 00:40:56.273
Speak quietly, please.


00:41:01.240 --> 00:41:02.434
Don't be scared.


00:41:02.960 --> 00:41:04.678
You can't live like that.


00:41:05.720 --> 00:41:07.312
Don't be afraid of anyone,


00:41:08.400 --> 00:41:09.628
not even Montse.


00:41:10.200 --> 00:41:11.394
That's easy to say.


00:41:13.880 --> 00:41:14.680
Are you alright?


00:41:15.800 --> 00:41:16.789
It hurts sometimes.


00:41:21.120 --> 00:41:23.236
It goes away if you come.


00:41:30.040 --> 00:41:33.393
It doesn't look good, does it?


00:41:33.520 --> 00:41:34.714
Montse has it under controI.


00:41:35.760 --> 00:41:37.478
- The doctor said...
- What doctor?


00:41:38.360 --> 00:41:40.157
Montse told me a doctor came.


00:41:40.680 --> 00:41:42.159
No doctor came to see you.


00:41:42.840 --> 00:41:44.592
Why would Montse lie to me?


00:41:45.720 --> 00:41:46.914
Because she's like that.


00:41:48.160 --> 00:41:49.912
I don't understand why you don't go.


00:41:50.560 --> 00:41:52.357
I wanted to see you again.


00:41:52.920 --> 00:41:53.955
Carlos, I'm serious.


00:41:56.520 --> 00:41:58.158
I can't go.


00:41:58.560 --> 00:42:01.916
When I was coming downstairs,
I was leaving.


00:42:02.280 --> 00:42:03.759
- On a trip?
- Well,


00:42:04.200 --> 00:42:06.475
you could say "on a trip",


00:42:06.840 --> 00:42:09.039
you could say "running away".


00:42:09.040 --> 00:42:11.076
I didn't intend to fall
down the stairs


00:42:11.440 --> 00:42:14.159
orfor Montse to hide me here,
but it's perfect.


00:42:14.520 --> 00:42:17.193
Don't be scared, not at all.


00:42:18.080 --> 00:42:19.479
It's not dangerous,


00:42:20.680 --> 00:42:21.874
foryou or Montse.


00:42:22.760 --> 00:42:24.751
But I can't tell you any more.


00:42:25.360 --> 00:42:27.669
I don't know what
you're running from,


00:42:28.640 --> 00:42:30.471
but you have to run from Montse.


00:42:32.480 --> 00:42:33.515
Montse's looking after me.


00:42:34.160 --> 00:42:35.479
Carlos, when you woke up,


00:42:36.680 --> 00:42:38.716
did she let you call anyone
to say you were here?


00:42:39.080 --> 00:42:41.036
Montse said you had no phone.


00:42:42.120 --> 00:42:42.950
Exactly.


00:42:43.440 --> 00:42:45.431
Exactly? What's going on?


00:42:45.840 --> 00:42:47.159
We do have a phone.


00:42:48.000 --> 00:42:50.239
And she din't tell you I live here.


00:42:50.240 --> 00:42:51.309
Don't you realize?


00:42:52.200 --> 00:42:53.000
Listen...


00:42:53.960 --> 00:42:54.760
What?


00:42:56.560 --> 00:42:58.278
I need a favor.


00:42:59.280 --> 00:43:01.032
- What?
- I need you to call Montse.


00:43:01.400 --> 00:43:02.200
What?


00:43:02.840 --> 00:43:05.479
She gives me something in water
to ease the pain.


00:43:05.840 --> 00:43:06.909
Call her, please. Call her.


00:43:07.280 --> 00:43:09.953
My God! She's giving you morphine.


00:43:10.840 --> 00:43:12.876
Morphine? Really?


00:43:13.240 --> 00:43:15.276
Don't you see?
She's kidnapped you!


00:43:15.760 --> 00:43:17.113
It's alright...


00:43:17.680 --> 00:43:19.193
Carlos, Carlos, look at me.


00:43:19.680 --> 00:43:21.398
She's in love with you,
she won't let you leave.


00:43:22.080 --> 00:43:24.036
- She'II let you die first...
- Forgive me.


00:43:24.760 --> 00:43:27.069
Forgive me, Elisa. Forgive me.


00:43:27.720 --> 00:43:29.519
- What's that?
- Forgive me, Elisa.


00:43:29.520 --> 00:43:31.511
- Carlos, what are you saying?
- Forgive me.


00:43:31.960 --> 00:43:33.951
- Carlos, I'm begging you.
- Forgive me.


00:43:34.320 --> 00:43:37.392
Forgive me! Forgive me, Elisa.
Forgive me!


00:43:38.000 --> 00:43:38.800
Forgive me!


00:43:39.040 --> 00:43:40.553
Forgive me!


00:43:45.240 --> 00:43:46.116
Forgive me!


00:43:47.200 --> 00:43:48.349
- Carlos!
- Forgive...


00:43:49.040 --> 00:43:51.508
Carlos, it's Montse. It's Montse!


00:43:52.080 --> 00:43:53.115
It's Montse!


00:43:54.000 --> 00:43:55.513
No! What do I do? What?!


00:43:56.400 --> 00:43:59.676
Forgive me. I'll stay, I'll stay.


00:44:00.280 --> 00:44:01.952
Forgive me. Forgive me.


00:44:26.880 --> 00:44:30.236
- Dad, he must be here.
- Do you really think so?


00:44:32.280 --> 00:44:34.999
I tell you, he's not here.
He's not even in Spain.


00:45:00.200 --> 00:45:01.000
Hello, Doña Puri.


00:45:01.280 --> 00:45:03.157
<i>Montse! How nice to hear from you.</i>


00:45:03.520 --> 00:45:05.351
<i>How are the exercises?
Are you doing them?</i>


00:45:05.760 --> 00:45:06.875
Yes, I am,


00:45:07.920 --> 00:45:11.469
but I'm getting more attacks now.


00:45:11.840 --> 00:45:14.354
<i>- I get terrible migraines.
- I suppose that's normal.</i>


00:45:14.840 --> 00:45:18.469
But I can't stand it,
they're just so severe.


00:45:19.520 --> 00:45:20.509
I need a dose.


00:45:20.880 --> 00:45:23.394
<i>Ah, the dose, of course.</i>


00:45:23.760 --> 00:45:25.796
<i>I'll bring it next time.</i>


00:45:26.160 --> 00:45:28.754
I mean I need more
than you usually bring.


00:45:30.280 --> 00:45:31.633
<i>Even more, Montse?</i>


00:45:32.520 --> 00:45:34.988
<i>You know what both
I and my husband</i>


00:45:35.320 --> 00:45:37.629
<i>are risking every time
I bring that little flask?</i>


00:45:38.000 --> 00:45:39.274
I can make it up to you.


00:45:39.640 --> 00:45:42.154
Rememberthat wedding dress
for your niece?


00:45:42.520 --> 00:45:45.512
I'll make it forfree.
It'll be my first.


00:45:45.880 --> 00:45:47.916
<i>You disappoint me, Montse,
it's a pity.</i>


00:45:48.280 --> 00:45:51.238
<i>But alright, if that's what you want,
I'll make you happy.</i>


00:45:52.040 --> 00:45:53.917
Thank you, thank you, madam.


00:45:54.280 --> 00:45:57.158
<i>- When shall I come?
- Whenever you wish.</i>


00:45:57.520 --> 00:46:00.353
<i>And I'll take you up on that dress.</i>


00:46:00.680 --> 00:46:02.479
<i>I'll bring her to get fitted.</i>


00:46:02.480 --> 00:46:05.233
Yes, of course.
Good idea. Thank you.


00:46:06.160 --> 00:46:07.559
<i>Goodbye, Montse.</i>


00:46:23.960 --> 00:46:24.760
Good morning.


00:46:25.480 --> 00:46:28.358
Excuse me, we're investigating
the disappearance of Carlos Cuenca,


00:46:28.720 --> 00:46:30.233
your upstairs neighbor.


00:46:30.920 --> 00:46:31.750
Do you know him?


00:46:32.160 --> 00:46:32.960
No.


00:46:36.160 --> 00:46:39.311
Have you heard any noise
or seen anything odd lately?


00:46:40.240 --> 00:46:41.040
No.


00:46:42.440 --> 00:46:43.350
May we come in?


00:46:50.880 --> 00:46:53.394
- Shall we go into the living room?
- No need, thank you.


00:46:55.720 --> 00:46:57.517
So you don't know your neighbor?


00:46:57.880 --> 00:46:58.869
That's right.


00:46:59.360 --> 00:47:01.749
- How long have you lived here?
- Since I was born.


00:47:03.200 --> 00:47:05.794
Your neighbor's lived here
quite some time.


00:47:07.080 --> 00:47:08.798
Are you sure you've never seen him?


00:47:12.200 --> 00:47:14.794
I have an illness that stops me
from going outside.


00:47:15.840 --> 00:47:18.354
I don't know anyone except
the permanents.


00:47:19.040 --> 00:47:21.031
- Do you live alone?
- With my sister.


00:47:21.560 --> 00:47:24.632
- Does she never go out either?
- Yes. She goes out.


00:47:25.040 --> 00:47:27.156
- May we speak to her?
- She's at work.


00:47:29.600 --> 00:47:30.430
Let's go.


00:47:31.600 --> 00:47:32.400
Very well.


00:47:33.440 --> 00:47:34.953
Ask your sister if she knows anything.


00:47:35.320 --> 00:47:36.878
If so,
tell herto call us at the station.


00:47:37.240 --> 00:47:38.040
Thank you.


00:47:39.280 --> 00:47:40.633
- Good day.
- Good day.


00:48:50.040 --> 00:48:51.758
Can I speak to you for a moment?


00:49:01.160 --> 00:49:03.390
I don't know where to start.


00:49:04.320 --> 00:49:05.833
You see,


00:49:06.480 --> 00:49:08.789
there are lots of things
you don't know about me.


00:49:09.440 --> 00:49:10.395
Bad things.


00:49:12.160 --> 00:49:14.435
But I don't mind you knowing.


00:49:17.440 --> 00:49:19.158
Since I've known you,
I haven't been scared,


00:49:19.640 --> 00:49:21.073
I've forgotten to be.


00:49:24.600 --> 00:49:27.273
No man has treated me like you,


00:49:27.840 --> 00:49:29.239
with respect and warmth.


00:49:32.800 --> 00:49:35.519
The truth is, I don't know
how to do these things.


00:49:36.000 --> 00:49:36.876
I suppose


00:49:37.240 --> 00:49:39.879
you simply try to say
what you feeI.


00:49:46.880 --> 00:49:49.997
I like you and I want...


00:49:50.360 --> 00:49:51.395
well,...


00:49:52.840 --> 00:49:55.638
I'd like to know if
you feeI the same for me.


00:49:56.880 --> 00:49:58.472
You're making it hard for me.


00:50:01.200 --> 00:50:05.159
Look at me. What do I have to do
foryou to call a doctor?


00:50:05.520 --> 00:50:06.475
A doctor already came.


00:50:06.840 --> 00:50:09.912
You're Iying.
Do you want me to die, Montse?


00:50:10.640 --> 00:50:11.550
No, for God's sake!


00:50:11.960 --> 00:50:14.793
Then do you want me
to be a cripple?


00:50:16.760 --> 00:50:17.795
Sick, like you?


00:50:19.680 --> 00:50:21.716
No. I only...


00:50:24.160 --> 00:50:25.036
What's wrong?


00:50:26.800 --> 00:50:29.872
What's wrong is that if I leave
this house, it'll be minus a leg.


00:50:31.400 --> 00:50:33.755
But I'd like to leave it alive.


00:50:37.280 --> 00:50:40.431
Why not drink the holy water?
That's what you need.


00:50:40.840 --> 00:50:42.751
I need to go to a hospitaI,


00:50:43.120 --> 00:50:45.999
not to be drugged with morphine.


00:50:46.000 --> 00:50:47.035
How do you know?


00:50:47.960 --> 00:50:49.757
I've come to know you well, Montse.


00:50:51.280 --> 00:50:54.431
Because you're
the same as me, a liar,


00:50:55.000 --> 00:50:58.231
incapable of telling the truth
to the people you love.


00:50:59.200 --> 00:51:01.236
Do you do the same to your sister?


00:51:01.760 --> 00:51:03.591
You say you love her,
but you're Iying.


00:51:04.440 --> 00:51:07.910
You abuse her,
lock her in your bubble.


00:51:09.000 --> 00:51:10.752
That's how you love.


00:51:11.400 --> 00:51:13.038
Is that how you love?
Look at me!


00:51:15.320 --> 00:51:17.754
"The truth will set you free. "


00:51:19.360 --> 00:51:22.679
Didn't the Son of God say that?


00:51:23.800 --> 00:51:25.597
Start by doing that.


00:51:26.240 --> 00:51:27.673
Start by telling the truth,


00:51:28.040 --> 00:51:31.316
and maybe that way
someone will love you one day.


00:51:53.200 --> 00:51:54.235
Who are you?


00:51:55.680 --> 00:51:57.432
The downstairs neighbor.


00:51:57.800 --> 00:52:00.997
- How'd you get in?
- I have Carlos' keys.


00:52:01.840 --> 00:52:02.795
Have you news of Carlos?


00:52:03.320 --> 00:52:05.436
He's at my place.
Are you his girlfriend?


00:52:08.120 --> 00:52:09.030
I ought to be his wife.


00:52:10.680 --> 00:52:12.716
We were to be married
the day he vanished.


00:52:13.640 --> 00:52:16.108
- Come on.
- No, no. I can't go.


00:52:16.480 --> 00:52:18.550
My sister would kill me
if I went down with you.


00:52:20.960 --> 00:52:21.760
The key.


00:52:27.960 --> 00:52:29.279
But...


00:52:29.600 --> 00:52:30.476
Wait.


00:52:32.080 --> 00:52:33.274
What are you going to do?


00:52:46.960 --> 00:52:48.279
Good work, my dear.


00:52:50.040 --> 00:52:51.268
You're worthless.


00:52:52.600 --> 00:52:55.398
Not even loved by a cripple.
Don't you see, little one?


00:52:55.760 --> 00:52:57.273
I'm not your little one.


00:52:58.600 --> 00:52:59.874
I'm not yours.


00:53:00.400 --> 00:53:01.549
Of course you're mine.


00:53:03.280 --> 00:53:04.554
You can't get away from me.


00:53:07.400 --> 00:53:08.310
Yes I can.


00:53:08.960 --> 00:53:11.872
Oh, yes? How?
By committing suicide?


00:53:12.720 --> 00:53:13.994
Carlos is right.


00:53:16.720 --> 00:53:18.597
"The truth will set you free. "


00:53:20.000 --> 00:53:23.037
- It's the word of God.
- And what does that mean?


00:53:24.360 --> 00:53:26.590
Will you tell the whole truth
to the "girI"?


00:53:27.800 --> 00:53:30.553
- You know you won't.
- We'll see.


00:53:31.160 --> 00:53:34.550
No, you're a coward.
You always have been.


00:53:34.960 --> 00:53:37.633
Your mouth's always full of things
you're going to do, but don't.


00:53:38.400 --> 00:53:39.799
Leave me alone!


00:53:54.240 --> 00:53:55.070
Where's Carlos?


00:53:56.120 --> 00:53:56.920
Excuse me?


00:53:58.360 --> 00:53:59.349
Get out of my house!


00:54:04.680 --> 00:54:06.830
I'd be delighted... with my husband.


00:54:08.240 --> 00:54:09.040
Carlos!


00:54:09.320 --> 00:54:12.630
No! No, no, don't do it!
Don't do it, please!


00:54:13.400 --> 00:54:14.628
Try stopping me.


00:54:15.200 --> 00:54:16.633
- Don't do it.
- Carlos!


00:54:18.200 --> 00:54:19.000
Carlos!


00:54:20.200 --> 00:54:22.077
Carlos, don't hide,
we're going home.


00:54:23.080 --> 00:54:23.956
Carlos!


00:54:25.880 --> 00:54:27.199
Carlos?


00:54:27.880 --> 00:54:30.030
Carlos, the party's over. Let's go!


00:54:31.240 --> 00:54:32.070
Carlos?


00:54:32.960 --> 00:54:33.760
Elisa...


00:54:34.200 --> 00:54:35.110
CarI...


00:54:36.560 --> 00:54:37.360
Elisa...


00:54:37.640 --> 00:54:39.949
- Elisa, get me out of here.
- What have they done to you?


00:54:40.320 --> 00:54:41.120
Get me...


00:54:41.480 --> 00:54:42.280
No!


00:54:48.320 --> 00:54:50.311
Murderer! Murderer!


00:54:50.680 --> 00:54:52.359
- Crazy woman! No!
- Shut up! Shut up!


00:54:52.360 --> 00:54:54.191
- Crazy! Crazy!
- Shut up!


00:54:56.760 --> 00:54:57.560
Shut up!


00:55:01.360 --> 00:55:02.395
I need to think.


00:55:41.280 --> 00:55:43.111
That's the Montse I know.


00:55:44.600 --> 00:55:45.400
Now what?


00:55:47.040 --> 00:55:47.995
Shut up.


00:55:52.840 --> 00:55:54.796
Are you going
to tell "the girI" this too?


00:55:56.640 --> 00:55:57.755
Apparently not.


00:55:59.040 --> 00:56:01.395
I love these moments of yours
before the storm.


00:56:02.400 --> 00:56:03.958
I never know
which way you'll jump.


00:56:06.840 --> 00:56:08.717
For example,
where will you hide the girI?


00:56:09.120 --> 00:56:12.519
There are no more empty spaces.


00:56:12.520 --> 00:56:13.509
We'll see.


00:59:25.200 --> 00:59:27.156
Please, no! Please!


00:59:31.720 --> 00:59:35.156
<i>You are invited to the wedding
of Carlos and Elisa.</i>


00:59:46.800 --> 00:59:47.755
Elisa?


00:59:51.040 --> 00:59:52.075
Elisa?


00:59:56.560 --> 00:59:57.629
Elisa?


01:00:01.640 --> 01:00:02.789
Elisa?


01:00:05.200 --> 01:00:06.189
Elisa?


01:00:10.760 --> 01:00:11.795
Montse.


01:00:24.600 --> 01:00:25.828
Where have you been?


01:00:27.280 --> 01:00:30.511
The store. It was stocktaking day.


01:00:33.240 --> 01:00:34.040
Can we talk?


01:00:38.320 --> 01:00:40.072
They were lovely, weren't they?


01:00:41.400 --> 01:00:42.469
Radiant.


01:00:45.800 --> 01:00:48.439
- How was your day?
- Hectic.


01:00:49.280 --> 01:00:50.952
Things happened


01:00:51.320 --> 01:00:52.753
that make you think.


01:00:58.120 --> 01:01:00.350
You're 18 now and...


01:01:01.280 --> 01:01:04.158
although you'll always be
my "girI",


01:01:06.200 --> 01:01:09.317
I have to accept reality:
you're not anymore.


01:01:10.360 --> 01:01:11.475
And I understand...


01:01:11.840 --> 01:01:14.513
the feeling of not wanting
to take any more.


01:01:14.880 --> 01:01:15.680
Montse, I...


01:01:15.840 --> 01:01:16.989
Listen...


01:01:18.440 --> 01:01:20.510
This is going to be hard for me.


01:01:22.680 --> 01:01:25.399
I just ask you to listen,
then say what you have to say.


01:01:28.600 --> 01:01:31.114
- What do you remember of Papa?
- Very little.


01:01:33.160 --> 01:01:34.957
He was tall and strong.


01:01:37.120 --> 01:01:39.076
With rough hands and face.


01:01:41.080 --> 01:01:41.880
Sad.


01:01:42.200 --> 01:01:43.349
He wasn't always.


01:01:44.160 --> 01:01:46.720
But Mama's death changed everything.


01:01:47.560 --> 01:01:50.028
It changed Papa,
he was sick with love.


01:01:51.520 --> 01:01:54.717
Maybe saying it
sounds poetic and romantic,


01:01:55.080 --> 01:01:56.672
but it's not.


01:01:58.280 --> 01:02:01.158
Being sick with love is
the most terrible thing there is.


01:02:04.680 --> 01:02:07.638
You always say you envy me
because I knew Mama,


01:02:08.920 --> 01:02:10.990
because I have portraits with her.


01:02:12.720 --> 01:02:14.153
And I understand.


01:02:14.680 --> 01:02:16.671
But I envy you too, because...


01:02:17.000 --> 01:02:19.070
you didn't see what Papa became.


01:02:20.720 --> 01:02:23.075
He stopped working,


01:02:24.160 --> 01:02:25.718
speaking, eating...


01:02:27.040 --> 01:02:29.349
He shut himself inside the home
and inside himself.


01:02:29.800 --> 01:02:31.711
He could only think of Mama.


01:02:34.040 --> 01:02:37.112
He tried to remember her
in every detaiI,


01:02:38.280 --> 01:02:39.508
in every thing,


01:02:40.880 --> 01:02:42.313
in every person,


01:02:46.160 --> 01:02:48.515
especially in his eldest daughter,


01:02:49.760 --> 01:02:52.228
who with every day
was more like his wife.


01:02:54.760 --> 01:02:56.990
I suppose that...


01:02:57.320 --> 01:02:59.470
in his madness,


01:02:59.880 --> 01:03:01.199
his love...


01:03:01.560 --> 01:03:04.518
for his daughter blended
with his love for his wife


01:03:06.200 --> 01:03:08.430
and he confused me with her.
I don't know.


01:03:08.960 --> 01:03:09.915
I don't know.


01:03:11.120 --> 01:03:11.996
I don't know.


01:03:33.120 --> 01:03:36.476
He abused me foryears, every night.


01:03:38.880 --> 01:03:41.758
I'd go into your room
to read from the Bible,


01:03:42.160 --> 01:03:42.960
remember?


01:03:43.160 --> 01:03:45.230
I just wanted you to go to sleep fast


01:03:45.560 --> 01:03:48.393
so you wouldn't hear
what happened in my room.


01:03:48.760 --> 01:03:50.193
That's all I wanted.


01:03:52.200 --> 01:03:53.000
It...


01:03:53.360 --> 01:03:55.828
wasn't the reaI him. No!


01:03:56.880 --> 01:03:58.871
Why take so long to tell me?


01:04:00.640 --> 01:04:02.198
Because telling you this...


01:04:03.120 --> 01:04:05.634
means telling you
what came next.


01:04:09.000 --> 01:04:10.274
Papa didn't desert us.


01:04:13.040 --> 01:04:15.952
One night, when I was going to
read to you from the Bible,


01:04:16.280 --> 01:04:18.510
I found Papa with you
in your room.


01:04:18.880 --> 01:04:20.472
<i>He was so far gone that..</i>


01:04:20.880 --> 01:04:23.348
<i>a terrible idea came to me.</i>


01:04:23.840 --> 01:04:26.229
What if he'd set his mind
on you too?


01:04:26.800 --> 01:04:28.279
You get prettier every day.


01:04:28.800 --> 01:04:30.631
You're the only beautifuI thing
in this house.


01:04:35.200 --> 01:04:36.269
Dinner's ready.


01:04:37.640 --> 01:04:39.710
<i>I was so full of rage right then.</i>


01:04:41.080 --> 01:04:43.992
<i>It came to me in a flash.</i>


01:05:11.160 --> 01:05:12.752
What's wrong? Aren't you eating?


01:05:14.320 --> 01:05:16.276
No wonder, this tastes like shit.


01:05:21.000 --> 01:05:22.592
Why are you two
gawping like idiots?


01:05:30.640 --> 01:05:31.789
What are you hiding there?


01:05:32.240 --> 01:05:33.040
Nothing.


01:05:45.760 --> 01:05:46.909
What are you hiding there?


01:05:49.040 --> 01:05:49.840
TERROR OF THE RATS


01:06:07.880 --> 01:06:08.949
Let me go!


01:06:09.760 --> 01:06:10.560
Let me go!


01:06:10.760 --> 01:06:12.910
Let me go! Let me go!


01:06:37.160 --> 01:06:39.037
<i>I took him to bed and laid him out.</i>


01:06:41.800 --> 01:06:43.916
<i>I took care of him
as if he weren't dead.</i>


01:06:46.080 --> 01:06:47.718
Shortly after, the War broke out,


01:06:48.080 --> 01:06:50.640
which helped me justify
his disappearance.


01:06:53.680 --> 01:06:56.274
I kept him here forweeks.


01:06:57.480 --> 01:06:59.232
When his body began to rot,


01:06:59.600 --> 01:07:01.158
I decided to hide him.


01:07:02.920 --> 01:07:04.592
Do you realize
what you've done to me?


01:07:04.920 --> 01:07:07.559
I know, but I want that to change.


01:07:08.440 --> 01:07:09.395
Please.


01:07:09.760 --> 01:07:12.035
Where'd you put him?
Where'd you hide him?


01:07:16.920 --> 01:07:17.720
Honey...


01:07:20.680 --> 01:07:22.955
- I understand you're angry, but...
- But what?


01:07:24.480 --> 01:07:26.471
My whole life
is a lie invented by you.


01:07:26.880 --> 01:07:28.108
I can't stay here.


01:07:29.120 --> 01:07:30.348
And where will you go?


01:07:31.080 --> 01:07:32.115
You can't do anything!


01:07:40.000 --> 01:07:42.150
I can go to the police
and tell them about Papa.


01:07:43.400 --> 01:07:44.628
I'm sure they'll find him.


01:08:41.040 --> 01:08:42.837
Oh, thank God!


01:08:43.680 --> 01:08:45.955
- Where is she?
- Elisa?


01:08:47.120 --> 01:08:48.838
I don't know what she did with her.


01:08:49.200 --> 01:08:51.077
The flat looks like nothing happened.


01:08:55.240 --> 01:08:56.753
She was pregnant.


01:08:58.040 --> 01:09:01.473
Elisa was expecting a child of mine.


01:09:02.080 --> 01:09:05.311
That's why I was running,
they were making me marry her.


01:09:09.080 --> 01:09:10.832
- It really hurts, doesn't it?
- A lot.


01:09:22.200 --> 01:09:23.918
No! No!


01:09:24.920 --> 01:09:25.720
No!


01:09:26.080 --> 01:09:28.071
- No! No!
- Carlos! Carlos!


01:09:28.480 --> 01:09:31.677
Please, Carlos. Listen to me.
Look at me, Carlos.


01:09:32.320 --> 01:09:33.389
She won't beat us.


01:10:31.560 --> 01:10:33.551
You see what you made me do.


01:10:36.240 --> 01:10:37.798
You were very naughty, Carlos.


01:10:38.680 --> 01:10:40.398
It was very disappointing.


01:10:41.840 --> 01:10:44.354
And don't think it was
a pleasure for me.


01:10:50.040 --> 01:10:50.916
I have a visitor.


01:10:52.240 --> 01:10:55.630
One word and I'll sew
your mouth shut next!


01:11:02.960 --> 01:11:06.111
Do you have any ideas
foryourwedding dress?


01:11:06.920 --> 01:11:07.720
Well...


01:11:08.000 --> 01:11:10.878
I don't know, I trust you


01:11:11.240 --> 01:11:12.832
because I love the dresses
you made for my aunt.


01:11:13.200 --> 01:11:16.078
Montse's very talented,
you should trust her judgment.


01:11:16.440 --> 01:11:17.316
Thank you.


01:11:17.680 --> 01:11:19.318
I'll make suggestions, but...


01:11:19.680 --> 01:11:21.830
- first I need some measurements.
- Alright.


01:11:23.320 --> 01:11:24.548
I'm so gratefuI, Montse.


01:11:25.280 --> 01:11:28.477
Thank you. But you know
it was in exchange for something.


01:11:28.840 --> 01:11:33.231
I brought it,
but I don't have it here.


01:11:35.000 --> 01:11:37.468
I ran into "the girI" on the stairs
and gave it to her.


01:11:37.840 --> 01:11:39.671
"The girI"? Why?


01:11:40.040 --> 01:11:42.315
I don't want you to
weaken in your recovery.


01:11:42.880 --> 01:11:44.950
- This dress is beautifuI.
- Thank you, dear.


01:11:46.920 --> 01:11:48.558
Are you doing my husband's exercises?


01:11:49.040 --> 01:11:51.395
Yes, but I've neglected them a bit.


01:11:51.960 --> 01:11:53.916
See? That's what I mean.


01:11:54.680 --> 01:11:57.035
Montse, that liquid is very tempting.


01:11:57.480 --> 01:11:58.999
The girI will know
how to administer it.


01:11:59.000 --> 01:12:02.079
You shouldn't have given it to her.


01:12:02.080 --> 01:12:03.672
- What was that?
- Something must've fallen.


01:12:04.040 --> 01:12:05.632
- Help!
- Who's there?


01:12:06.000 --> 01:12:07.752
- Excuse me a moment.
- Get me out of here!


01:12:09.720 --> 01:12:11.915
Help! Help!


01:12:15.240 --> 01:12:16.798
You don't make it easy for me!


01:12:27.160 --> 01:12:30.434
Let's get out of here right now!


01:12:31.840 --> 01:12:32.989
What have you done, Montse?


01:12:33.360 --> 01:12:34.190
What have you done?


01:12:34.560 --> 01:12:37.313
Nothing, just defending my home.


01:12:37.880 --> 01:12:38.835
You don't understand.


01:12:39.200 --> 01:12:41.111
But... how can I understand this?


01:12:44.960 --> 01:12:46.109
What are you going to do?


01:12:47.000 --> 01:12:49.594
The same thing, defend my home.


01:12:49.960 --> 01:12:51.996
No, listen, I can talk to my husband.


01:12:52.400 --> 01:12:54.960
There's time to cure you,
if that's what you really want.


01:12:55.320 --> 01:12:57.311
And he's got lots of friends
in the police.


01:12:57.680 --> 01:12:59.910
We can make this disappear.


01:13:00.360 --> 01:13:03.716
I'm sorry, Doña Puri. It's too late.


01:13:04.640 --> 01:13:06.710
There's no salvation for me now.


01:13:12.880 --> 01:13:16.190
The morphine! Montse!
How will you get morphine


01:13:16.520 --> 01:13:17.555
if you do this to me?


01:13:18.040 --> 01:13:19.553
God will provide.


01:13:32.360 --> 01:13:34.237
I was waiting for you.


01:13:38.120 --> 01:13:40.998
I need what Doña Puri gave you.


01:13:41.520 --> 01:13:42.320
My God!


01:13:45.640 --> 01:13:47.790
Give me what Doña Puri gave you.


01:13:48.160 --> 01:13:49.229
What did you do to Carlos?


01:13:53.880 --> 01:13:55.791
Get me out of here.
Get me out, please.


01:13:56.400 --> 01:13:58.630
- Give it to me!
- Look out! No! No!


01:13:59.040 --> 01:14:00.199
- Give it to me!
- Montse, no.


01:14:00.200 --> 01:14:02.430
- Alright, alright.
- Leave her alone!


01:14:02.800 --> 01:14:03.835
Here they are.


01:14:04.200 --> 01:14:05.000
Hold it!


01:14:06.800 --> 01:14:07.994
Give it to me, please.


01:14:12.480 --> 01:14:13.435
What have you done?


01:14:13.800 --> 01:14:14.915
There's still another.


01:14:15.640 --> 01:14:18.677
If you want it whole,
don't move a muscle.


01:14:21.400 --> 01:14:22.674
If you drop it,


01:14:24.280 --> 01:14:26.396
I swear I'll go in and kill him.


01:14:26.800 --> 01:14:29.439
Why are you covered in blood?


01:14:29.440 --> 01:14:31.795
Doña Puri discovered Carlos.


01:14:32.280 --> 01:14:33.395
And his wife.


01:14:34.600 --> 01:14:36.909
They're in the sewing room.


01:14:38.120 --> 01:14:39.758
Carlos' fiancée was pregnant.


01:14:40.880 --> 01:14:42.233
You didn't know, did you?


01:14:42.960 --> 01:14:43.870
That's you.


01:14:44.720 --> 01:14:47.029
You've killed three innocent women
and a baby.


01:14:47.880 --> 01:14:51.031
And Papa too.
What's stopping you from killing me?


01:14:51.400 --> 01:14:52.355
But do you know what?


01:14:53.440 --> 01:14:55.670
That certainty doesn't
scare me anymore.


01:14:56.480 --> 01:14:57.280
On the contrary,


01:14:58.680 --> 01:15:00.159
it gives me strength.


01:15:08.400 --> 01:15:09.200
What have you done?


01:15:09.560 --> 01:15:11.596
The same thing you do to people.


01:15:12.000 --> 01:15:13.831
Who do you think God will forgive?


01:15:15.000 --> 01:15:15.800
You...


01:15:16.720 --> 01:15:17.835
or me?


01:15:27.600 --> 01:15:28.749
Now we're even.


01:15:53.400 --> 01:15:54.200
We're leaving.


01:16:08.440 --> 01:16:10.078
Come on, Carlos, help me, please.


01:16:11.080 --> 01:16:11.956
Pull there.


01:16:13.200 --> 01:16:15.270
Yes, that's it.


01:16:15.840 --> 01:16:16.640
Good.


01:16:19.320 --> 01:16:21.197
- Can you take the weight?
- Yes.


01:16:21.560 --> 01:16:22.390
Go on then.


01:16:23.640 --> 01:16:24.440
Let's go.


01:16:30.320 --> 01:16:31.435
See that?


01:16:32.280 --> 01:16:33.872
Look what you've turned her into.


01:16:34.840 --> 01:16:36.637
Come on.


01:16:37.440 --> 01:16:39.271
- I can't.
- Like that.


01:16:39.640 --> 01:16:41.358
- I can't.
- Carlos, no.


01:16:41.920 --> 01:16:43.069
Carlos, come on.


01:16:43.680 --> 01:16:47.119
She doesn't look like my daughter.


01:16:47.120 --> 01:16:48.917
Though, in the end,
I didn't raise her.


01:16:50.440 --> 01:16:52.351
Alright, we'll do it another way.


01:16:52.720 --> 01:16:54.039
Sit up.


01:16:57.080 --> 01:16:58.877
Like this.


01:17:02.360 --> 01:17:03.873
Carlos, come on.


01:17:11.320 --> 01:17:12.309
Carlos, please, help me.


01:17:13.640 --> 01:17:16.518
Now she's fleeing with your boyfriend.
I hope you do something.


01:17:17.240 --> 01:17:20.710
Leave me alone! Leave me alone!


01:17:25.560 --> 01:17:26.360
Like that.


01:17:28.320 --> 01:17:31.548
Come on, honey, she's getting away.


01:17:36.600 --> 01:17:37.400
No!


01:18:31.920 --> 01:18:33.148
Don't kill me.


01:18:34.240 --> 01:18:35.673
Don't kill me.


01:18:39.280 --> 01:18:40.713
I didn't want this, Montse.


01:18:58.400 --> 01:18:59.200
What?


01:19:02.840 --> 01:19:05.638
Papa took a photo
when you were born.


01:19:08.400 --> 01:19:09.200
What?


01:19:09.480 --> 01:19:11.311
A photo with Mama.


01:19:13.560 --> 01:19:15.073
You're Iying.


01:19:15.960 --> 01:19:17.234
That's impossible.


01:19:22.360 --> 01:19:23.793
I hid it with Papa.


01:19:25.440 --> 01:19:27.032
Do you want to know where?


01:21:23.720 --> 01:21:25.472
I couldn't tell you.


01:21:27.360 --> 01:21:29.316
I was ashamed.


01:21:31.000 --> 01:21:32.877
<i>Go to sleep,</i>


01:21:33.240 --> 01:21:34.832
<i>my baby,</i>


01:21:35.200 --> 01:21:39.352
<i>outside the moon is bright.</i>


01:21:39.720 --> 01:21:44.032
<i>She protects her mantle,</i>


01:21:44.400 --> 01:21:48.632
<i>I protect my cradle.</i>


01:21:50.040 --> 01:21:53.350
<i>Now my baby is asleep,</i>


01:21:54.720 --> 01:21:58.474
<i>now her crying is hushed.</i>


01:21:59.280 --> 01:22:02.909
<i>The seamstress stars</i>


01:22:03.800 --> 01:22:07.395
<i>rock her sleep and my song.</i>


01:22:09.000 --> 01:22:12.310
<i>Now my baby is asleep,</i>


01:22:13.160 --> 01:22:16.869
<i>the mint take its rest.</i>


01:22:18.040 --> 01:22:21.316
<i>Spring is here</i>


01:22:22.840 --> 01:22:26.469
<i>and the frost is melting.</i>


01:22:27.400 --> 01:22:29.994
The other day I realized
I don't know your name.


01:22:39.920 --> 01:22:42.593
It's beautifuI. BeautifuI.


01:22:46.440 --> 01:22:47.634
Relax, relax.


01:22:49.840 --> 01:22:50.795
We did it.


01:23:17.080 --> 01:23:18.877
<i>Shrews are rodents</i>


01:23:19.200 --> 01:23:21.077
<i>that burrow long caves underground,</i>


01:23:21.960 --> 01:23:23.598
<i>far from other animals.</i>


01:23:25.600 --> 01:23:27.397
<i>They have solitary customs</i>


01:23:27.760 --> 01:23:29.910
<i>and some have venomous glands</i>


01:23:30.280 --> 01:23:32.157
<i>to immobilize larger prey.</i>

